WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.089
The CPU, or Central Processing Unit, is your computer's brain.

00:05.089 --> 00:09.070
It constantly fetches instructions and data from memory.

00:09.070 --> 00:14.208
Next, the CPU decodes these instructions to understand the task.

00:14.210 --> 00:19.969
Then, it executes the tasks, performing calculations and operations.

00:19.969 --> 00:24.649
Finally, the results are stored back in memory or sent to output.
